  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">借鉴金苹果和附魔金苹果的风格，本模组加入了各种镀金的原版食物以及它们的附魔金版本。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要和朋友联机游玩吗？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在寻找能与朋友畅玩任意模组或整合包的服务器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 是您的理想选择！他们提供性价比最高的Minecraft服务器，点击<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong>并使用优惠码\"Lupin\"即可享受25%折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">本模组为原版食物添加了黄金与附魔黄金变种。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">所有食物都会提供与金苹果和附魔金苹果相同的效果。至于金胡萝卜，其制作方式已调整为需要金锭。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">所有黄金食物都需要金锭制作，而附魔黄金食物则需要通过新附魔\"黄金食物附魔\"获得，该附魔可在原版附魔台上用30级经验值进行附魔（需放置书）。</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>是否兼容其他添加食物的模组？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">暂不兼容，目前仅支持\"原版\"食物。不过我们计划未来让模组兼容主流食物模组添加的其他食物类型。虽然这不是优先事项，但您可以在评论区留下建议。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>如何获得附魔变种？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">只能通过获取新附魔来制作。要获得该附魔，必须达到30级经验值，并在附魔台上放置书本后凭运气获得。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>支持服务器吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！运行完美！请记住，与朋友畅玩模组的最佳方式是使用BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>点击此链接可享25%折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模组可用于整合包吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然！但仅限于在Modrinth或CurseForge平台发布。上传至其他平台将侵犯我们的权利，完全不被允许。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果您考虑将其加入您的Modrinth或CurseForge整合包，我们将不胜感激。如需任何小调整或有疑问，请联系我们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以录制模组视频并在频道展示吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然，欢迎您在频道中游玩此模组或我们的任何整合包并制作视频，事实上我们会对此表示衷心感谢！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/3/golden-foods-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1063\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/6/golden-foods-3.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1063\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></a></p>",
